graph TB
    User["Data Scientist / Client"]
    KServe["KServe<br/>ServingRuntime / InferenceService"]
    Operator["RHOAI operator<br/>ServingRuntime template"]
    StorageInit["KServe storage-initializer<br/>(init container)"]
    KRP["kube-rbac-proxy sidecar<br/>(when IS auth enabled)"]
    Prometheus["Prometheus /<br/>User Workload Monitoring"]
    OTLP["OTLP collector<br/>(optional)"]
    Kafka["Kafka brokers<br/>(optional, off by default)"]

    subgraph Pod["Predictor Pod (user namespace)"]
        ModelsVol[("/mnt/models<br/>shared volume")]

        subgraph MLServer["MLServer process (mlserver start)"]
            Core["mlserver core<br/>CLI, model registry,<br/>dataplane handlers, codecs,<br/>adaptive batching"]
            REST["REST server<br/>uvicorn / FastAPI<br/>0.0.0.0:8080 HTTP"]
            GRPC["gRPC server<br/>grpc.aio, add_insecure_port<br/>0.0.0.0:8081 h2c"]
            Metrics["Metrics server<br/>uvicorn<br/>0.0.0.0:8082 /metrics"]
            KafkaSrv["Kafka server<br/>aiokafka (optional)"]
            Pool["Parallel inference pool<br/>multiprocessing workers"]
            Allowlist["Trusted runtime allowlist<br/>/etc/mlserver/trusted-runtimes.json<br/>PRODUCTION mode"]

            subgraph Runtimes["Runtime plugins (installed in RHOAI images)"]
                SK["mlserver-sklearn<br/>(CPU)"]
                XGB["mlserver-xgboost<br/>(CPU)"]
                LGBM["mlserver-lightgbm<br/>(CPU)"]
                ONNX["mlserver-onnx<br/>(CPU: onnxruntime,<br/>CUDA: onnxruntime-gpu)"]
            end
        end
    end

    NotShipped["Upstream-only runtimes (NOT in RHOAI images)<br/>alibi-detect, alibi-explain, catboost,<br/>huggingface, mlflow, mllib"]

    Operator -->|ships template referencing<br/>odh-mlserver-rhel9 / -cuda-rhel9| KServe
    User -->|creates InferenceService| KServe
    KServe -->|deploys image, injects| StorageInit
    KServe -->|injects| KRP
    StorageInit -->|writes model artifacts| ModelsVol

    User -->|V2 inference via Gateway/Route| KRP
    KRP -->|HTTP 8080 localhost| REST
    KRP -->|gRPC 8081 localhost| GRPC

    REST --> Core
    GRPC --> Core
    KafkaSrv --> Core
    Core -->|reads model-settings.json| ModelsVol
    Core -->|validates implementation| Allowlist
    Allowlist -->|permits| Runtimes
    Core -->|dispatches inference| Pool
    Pool --> Runtimes

    Prometheus -->|scrape HTTP 8082| Metrics
    Core -.->|OTLP/gRPC insecure=True| OTLP
    KafkaSrv -.->|plaintext, no SASL/SSL| Kafka

